(7086568, 1078468, 153814, '<td valign="top">I have to say it''s not the most intersting shot but I like how the bokeh kind of fills in the blanks. All in all I like it.</td>', 'I have to say it''s not the most intersting shot but I like how the bokeh kind of fills in the blanks. All in all I like it.', '2013-08-13 15:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
