(7086574, 1078842, 153814, '<td valign="top">Great action shot here and great colors.<br/>The bokeh is real nice here I would have liked to see a bit less bird and a bit more bokeh.(For this challenge anyway)<br/>ALl in all nicely done.</td>', 'Great action shot here and great colors.The bokeh is real nice here I would have liked to see a bit less bird and a bit more bokeh.(For this challenge anyway)ALl in all nicely done.', '2013-08-13 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7086577, 1078453, 153814, '<td valign="top">I like how you image is layed out the bokeh has a great mix of curves, squares, lights and darks. Very nice.<br/>It does seem a bit grainy, still Nicely done.</td>', 'I like how you image is layed out the bokeh has a great mix of curves, squares, lights and darks. Very nice.It does seem a bit grainy, still Nicely done.', '2013-08-13 15:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
