(7086594, 1078966, 153814, '<td valign="top">I have to say this is kind of creepy but I like it.<br/>Stands out nice against the bokeh.</td>', 'I have to say this is kind of creepy but I like it.Stands out nice against the bokeh.', '2013-08-13 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
