(7087091, 1079017, 119863, '<td valign="top">"Woahhh."  This one''s completely different from what I''ve seen so far.  Crisp birding shots are great, but I really like the abstractness of this shot. I could be waking up on a beige tile floor, napping on hardpacked dirt at sunset, floating in a calm lake.</td>', '"Woahhh."  This one''s completely different from what I''ve seen so far.  Crisp birding shots are great, but I really like the abstractness of this shot. I could be waking up on a beige tile floor, napping on hardpacked dirt at sunset, floating in a calm lake.', '2013-08-14 01:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087097, 1078951, 119863, '<td valign="top">rainbow bokeh for the daily double! Beautiful shot, I like the subject peeking out, the contrast not overdone</td>', 'rainbow bokeh for the daily double! Beautiful shot, I like the subject peeking out, the contrast not overdone', '2013-08-14 01:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087107, 1078906, 119863, '<td valign="top">This certainly came out of left field.  Brenizer method?  I think this could have actually benefitted from greater DOF; more rock detail could be afforded since you don''t have to worry about competing attention</td>', 'This certainly came out of left field.  Brenizer method?  I think this could have actually benefitted from greater DOF; more rock detail could be afforded since you don''t have to worry about competing attention', '2013-08-14 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087108, 1079102, 119863, '<td valign="top">She might be your model but the other person got the better shot IMO :/ Heavy falloff, all context blurred for the sake of bokeh and not enough facial coverage to read emotion.</td>', 'She might be your model but the other person got the better shot IMO :/ Heavy falloff, all context blurred for the sake of bokeh and not enough facial coverage to read emotion.', '2013-08-14 02:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087123, 1078950, 161157, '<td valign="top">I am sure someone''s mother in law looks like this. I like your picture. :)</td>', 'I am sure someone''s mother in law looks like this. I like your picture. :)', '2013-08-14 02:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087199, 1078842, 46524, '<td valign="top">nice bokeh here.</td>', 'nice bokeh here.', '2013-08-14 07:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087211, 1079100, 118154, '<td valign="top">In the top area somewhere in my view,ott in a way but that is ok with me.</td>', 'In the top area somewhere in my view,ott in a way but that is ok with me.', '2013-08-14 08:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087213, 1078923, 118154, '<td valign="top">This is nice ,not the best bokeh but great look.</td>', 'This is nice ,not the best bokeh but great look.', '2013-08-14 08:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087214, 1079072, 118154, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh ,not sure the crop is the best</td>', 'Love the bokeh ,not sure the crop is the best', '2013-08-14 08:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087215, 1079055, 118154, '<td valign="top">A good way,nice image.</td>', 'A good way,nice image.', '2013-08-14 08:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087216, 1079067, 118154, '<td valign="top">Colors are fabby dabby ,boosting on second look.</td>', 'Colors are fabby dabby ,boosting on second look.', '2013-08-14 08:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087220, 1078951, 65234, '<td valign="top">Peekaboo, dragonfly!  Simply gorgeous image and the bokeh adds a wonderful feeling of magical places.</td>', 'Peekaboo, dragonfly!  Simply gorgeous image and the bokeh adds a wonderful feeling of magical places.', '2013-08-14 09:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087225, 1079005, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those are so lovely!  And there''s a little bonus spider, I think.  The bokeh softly complements the delicacy of the subject and the color palette is so very pretty.</td>', 'Those are so lovely!  And there''s a little bonus spider, I think.  The bokeh softly complements the delicacy of the subject and the color palette is so very pretty.', '2013-08-14 09:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087227, 1079055, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do love peeks into the world of bugs.  Nice, curvey lines from the grass and the bokeh adds interesting shapes.</td>', 'I do love peeks into the world of bugs.  Nice, curvey lines from the grass and the bokeh adds interesting shapes.', '2013-08-14 09:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087229, 1079046, 65234, '<td valign="top">Spectacular butterfly!  I want one :-)  Bokeh is a bit busy with everything else in the scene; I might have cropped out the floweron the right.</td>', 'Spectacular butterfly!  I want one :-)  Bokeh is a bit busy with everything else in the scene; I might have cropped out the floweron the right.', '2013-08-14 09:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087230, 1079017, 65234, '<td valign="top">Minimalist bokeh, but it works.  Nice mood to this.</td>', 'Minimalist bokeh, but it works.  Nice mood to this.', '2013-08-14 09:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087231, 1079067, 65234, '<td valign="top">It does resemble a fairyland!</td>', 'It does resemble a fairyland!', '2013-08-14 09:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087232, 1079048, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice butterfly and rich color.</td>', 'Nice butterfly and rich color.', '2013-08-14 09:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087235, 1078842, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good job, dad! The greens are a nice complement to the Cardinals.</td>', 'Good job, dad! The greens are a nice complement to the Cardinals.', '2013-08-14 09:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087237, 1079074, 65234, '<td valign="top">Years ago I entered a shot much like this one, so naturally I like it :-). The light in the background produced some nice bokeh.</td>', 'Years ago I entered a shot much like this one, so naturally I like it :-). The light in the background produced some nice bokeh.', '2013-08-14 09:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087238, 1079043, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and I particularly like the little dots of light along the leaf.</td>', 'Nice colors and I particularly like the little dots of light along the leaf.', '2013-08-14 09:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087239, 1078843, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good thing the hat isn''t holding on too tightly ;-)</td>', 'Good thing the hat isn''t holding on too tightly ;-)', '2013-08-14 09:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087376, 1079067, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the color coordination going on here.</td>', 'I really like the color coordination going on here.', '2013-08-14 16:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087377, 1079074, 114225, '<td valign="top">The blown highlights in the hair take away from this image. That loss of detail is key.</td>', 'The blown highlights in the hair take away from this image. That loss of detail is key.', '2013-08-14 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087378, 1078356, 114225, '<td valign="top">A powerful image.</td>', 'A powerful image.', '2013-08-14 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087481, 1079021, 65234, '<td valign="top">Youngsters should avoid caffeine LOL.  Cute bird; bokeh is subtle, but sets off the bird nicely.</td>', 'Youngsters should avoid caffeine LOL.  Cute bird; bokeh is subtle, but sets off the bird nicely.', '2013-08-14 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087574, 1079017, 115814, '<td valign="top">Ethereal lightness and tonal sophistication. Love this.</td>', 'Ethereal lightness and tonal sophistication. Love this.', '2013-08-15 01:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087577, 1079055, 115814, '<td valign="top">Not typically a fan of insect shots (even ones I''ve submitted). But... This is SO nicely done. The compositional echos of the arcing leaves... the lovely soft background bokeh... the simple color palette... Wow.</td>', 'Not typically a fan of insect shots (even ones I''ve submitted). But... This is SO nicely done. The compositional echos of the arcing leaves... the lovely soft background bokeh... the simple color palette... Wow.', '2013-08-15 01:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087579, 1079107, 115814, '<td valign="top">My attention is first drawn to the yellow, then immediately to the cracks in the window. The blue-yellow complements give it a distinct moodiness. Is it a train in the background?  Whatever, it''s an exceptional image.</td>', 'My attention is first drawn to the yellow, then immediately to the cracks in the window. The blue-yellow complements give it a distinct moodiness. Is it a train in the background?  Whatever, it''s an exceptional image.', '2013-08-15 02:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087581, 1079110, 115814, '<td valign="top">The color gradients in the background are so nice and the bokeh is perfect behind the daisy. I wish there was more detail in the subject petals. 8</td>', 'The color gradients in the background are so nice and the bokeh is perfect behind the daisy. I wish there was more detail in the subject petals. 8', '2013-08-15 02:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087582, 1079053, 115814, '<td valign="top">Nice! The bokeh is soft and echoes the colors of the pups coat. I find the center highlight (below the ear) to be a distraction and the border is too much. I think it would work better with no border (of maybe just the innermost thin black line.</td>', 'Nice! The bokeh is soft and echoes the colors of the pups coat. I find the center highlight (below the ear) to be a distraction and the border is too much. I think it would work better with no border (of maybe just the innermost thin black line.', '2013-08-15 02:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087583, 1078979, 115814, '<td valign="top">Lovely boken, for sure. But for me, the very narrow DOF and softness of the subject isn''t enough pay-off for the background.</td>', 'Lovely boken, for sure. But for me, the very narrow DOF and softness of the subject isn''t enough pay-off for the background.', '2013-08-15 02:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087585, 1079048, 115814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful patterns and sharpness on the subject. For me, the prominence of the white flowers (on the focal plane of the butterfly and in the background) distracts attention from the delicate details of the wing.</td>', 'Beautiful patterns and sharpness on the subject. For me, the prominence of the white flowers (on the focal plane of the butterfly and in the background) distracts attention from the delicate details of the wing.', '2013-08-15 02:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087588, 1078878, 115814, '<td valign="top">Really clever idea. The fill light on the subject''s back and the prominence of the tagging on the bench takes away from the terrific background.</td>', 'Really clever idea. The fill light on the subject''s back and the prominence of the tagging on the bench takes away from the terrific background.', '2013-08-15 02:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087590, 1079066, 115814, '<td valign="top">Bubbles of Joy! Nice</td>', 'Bubbles of Joy! Nice', '2013-08-15 02:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087591, 1079067, 115814, '<td valign="top">Such an interesting color palette. Very nice!</td>', 'Such an interesting color palette. Very nice!', '2013-08-15 02:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7087592, 1079075, 115814, '<td valign="top">Cool! To me, the fronds are like blades/fingers and the highlight area evokes the face from Munch''s Scream. 8</td>', 'Cool! To me, the fronds are like blades/fingers and the highlight area evokes the face from Munch''s Scream. 8', '2013-08-15 02:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
