(7089696, 1079102, 121986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bmartuch:</b></div><hr/><i> Excellent job on the processing and composition. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t really process much.  I used the clarity slider in ACR to add detail to the boke, but not much else.</td>', 'Originally posted by bmartuch: Excellent job on the processing and composition.   I don''t really process much.  I used the clarity slider in ACR to add detail to the boke, but not much else.', '2013-08-19 15:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7089698, 1079102, 121986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> so did the other guy in this challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No he didn''t.  She was already in my car when I found him standing in the street outside his house.</td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: so did the other guy in this challenge.   No he didn''t.  She was already in my car when I found him standing in the street outside his house.', '2013-08-19 15:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7089699, 1079102, 121986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by theFREDfactor:</b></div><hr/><i> Nicely done but the bokeh looks like it was manipulated during processing. Does not look natural. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I used the clarity slider in ACR to add sharpness to it.</td>', 'Originally posted by theFREDfactor: Nicely done but the bokeh looks like it was manipulated during processing. Does not look natural.   I used the clarity slider in ACR to add sharpness to it.', '2013-08-19 15:31:49.000000', NULL, 0),
