(7089733, 1079070, 94815, '<td valign="top">I thought this was yours. Lynn can attest to that. Ok the gallery venue was a hint but also the juxtaposition that seems like your eye. I confess to thinking it was almost too obvious to be yours but there were no others with the right combination of ambiguity and venue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-19 17:00:53.</i></td>', 'I thought this was yours. Lynn can attest to that. Ok the gallery venue was a hint but also the juxtaposition that seems like your eye. I confess to thinking it was almost too obvious to be yours but there were no others with the right combination of ambiguity and venue.', '2013-08-19 17:59:32.000000', '2013-08-19 18:00:53.000000', 0),
