(7089893, 1078959, 25773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by grahamgator:</b></div><hr/><i> This little fellows are very hard to photograph.  I have been trying all summer and have a few that came out nice using focus stacking.  Nicely done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Mary Ann and congrats for the Blue!</td>', 'Originally posted by grahamgator: This little fellows are very hard to photograph.  I have been trying all summer and have a few that came out nice using focus stacking.  Nicely done.   Thanks, Mary Ann and congrats for the Blue!', '2013-08-20 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 0),
